# Postposed daypart words that keep a bare 12-hour clock reading in the
# morning/night half (meridiem offset 0), the am counterpart of
# clock_meridiem_pm.voc.  "klokken tre om natten" == 03:00, "klokken ni om
# formiddagen" == 09:00; only the noon/midnight edge is rewritten (12 -> 0).
# Bands: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale da -- nat [00:00, 05:00),
# morgen [05:00, 10:00) and formiddag [10:00, 12:00) are the am half.
natten
morgenen
formiddagen
